                                    EventHolder.timestampKey, new DateTime("2013-01-01T04"),
                                    "dim", "fifth"
                            ))
                    )
            )
    );

    // Early-return paths must preserve the exact non-null result instance.
    Assert.assertSame(res2, binaryFn.apply(null, res2));
    Assert.assertSame(res1, binaryFn.apply(res1, null));

    Result<SelectResultValue> merged = binaryFn.apply(res1, res2);
